await app:none 5

# 8 THE HOLDING (Guide.way_goal `holding`, Holding; 46_settlements, SnatchNight):
# Oyster Row saw him make the armour, and it is predicted, not he: the small
# hours after he has gone, the plan comes for one of its people. With somebody he
# has met taken, the goal line puts the people before the archive: beds at a
# holding of his. A lean-to is the first piece, of driftwood and a rag off a
# shack; it founds the holding. Then he asks the village, and whoever the bed
# takes walks there with him. The night passes while he is away at the camp, the
# lamp put out for it (one flask: a night jumped with it lit burns it dry). The
# plan comes in the small hours a seed picks (SnatchNight.due), so the clock goes
# to that, then on to first light, when he can see to gather without the lamp
# (Survival DARK_NIGHTFALL). Whether he is back from the lab before midnight or
# after, it is the same morning. He goes down to Oyster Row, which lost one of
# its own in the night, and eats off its bushes. Its nearest berry bushes were
# eaten from last evening, and some of the next nearest give no berries, so the
# loop has room for those tries.
tap lamp
await unlit 2
hour snatch
await taken 10
hour 6
village 0
wait 1.0
try 14
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
  await goal:holding 2
end
shot 15-beds-before-the-archive with goal:holding
# A berry buys an hour and a half: a day of gathering and building wants four
# more, eaten off the carry page (never `use` on open ground, which asks to sleep).
try 3
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
end
try 3
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
end
try 3
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
end
try 3
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
end
village 0
wait 1.0
try 3
  near driftwood
  press use 0.1
  await took:driftwood 4
end
try 3
  near driftwood
  press use 0.1
  await took:driftwood 4
end
# The pick in hand breaks wreckage for plate; with the knife in hand (which it
# does not cut) his bare hands pull the rag out of it. Looked for from Oyster
# Row, a named place, and not from wherever the driftwood left him; and only
# wreckage, since with the knife held a shack is turned for scrap and the block
# went round again for the rag.
tap inventory
wait 0.5
choose knife
tap use
wait 0.3
tap inventory
wait 0.4
village 0
wait 0.6
try 6
  near wreckage
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:rag 12
end
place spawn
wait 0.6
tap holding
await app:holding 4
choose build_lean_to
tap use
await made 8
tap pause
wait 1.0
shot 16-a-holding-founded with holding,goal:raft
village 0
wait 1.5
near holding_ask
wait 0.5
tap use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 17-he-offers-a-bed with talking
tap use
await moved 3
wait 0.4
tap use
wait 0.8
walkto holding 30
walk 1,-1 1.0
until walked_in 40
wait 0.8
shot 18-one-of-them-home-at-the-holding with holding,walked_in
